Membership renewal submissions are used to build the central member database from scratch. Every public membership renewal form submission receives a NEW unique MedLife membership number; existing volunteer profile numbers are never reused for a new submission. The issued number is authoritative for the submission, profile, membership card, and email.

Content-writing cells are resolved only from active org_units. Submitted assignment cell IDs are canonicalized against live cells, including a unique name fallback, and assignment cells are merged into the submitted unit set.
Certificate unit links are validated independently against active units, so multiple current units and multiple certificate records remain isolated.

